menuconfig NUCODE_RADIO_IEEE802154
	bool "NUCODE standalone IEEE 802.15.4 radio API"
	depends on NUCODE_ARDUINO_API
	depends on NRF_802154_RADIO_DRIVER
	help
	  단독 nRF 802.15.4 driver의 ACK, bounded retry, sequence/hash,
	  cancel, STOP과 수신 buffer 반환 API를 제공합니다.

menuconfig NUCODE_RADIO_ESB
	bool "NUCODE standalone Enhanced ShockBurst radio API"
	depends on NUCODE_ARDUINO_API
	depends on ESB
	help
	  단독 ESB PTX/PRX, hardware ACK/retry, sequence/hash,
	  cancel, STOP과 FIFO 반환 API를 제공합니다.
